---
title: "withdraw (Sui Framework: kiosk)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_access: assert self.has_access(cap)
    q_check_access --> q_abort_owner: no access
    q_abort_owner --> [*]: abort ENotOwner
    q_check_access --> q_check_amount: has access
    q_check_amount --> q_specific: amount.is_some()
    q_specific --> q_check_enough: amt = amount.destroy_some()
    q_check_enough --> q_abort_enough: amt > self.profits.value()
    q_abort_enough --> [*]: abort ENotEnough
    q_check_enough --> q_take: amt <= profits
    q_check_amount --> q_all: amount.is_none()
    q_all --> q_take: amt = self.profits.value()
    q_take --> [*]: return coin::take(self.profits, amount, ctx)

    note right of q_check_access
        INV-001: only kiosk owner can withdraw profits
        INV-002: cannot withdraw more than available profits
        INV-003: withdraw does not affect items or listings
    end note
